      "title": "Compass Center for Career & Calling",
      "description": "Compass Center for Career & Calling  | Northwestern College in Iowa Skip Navigation MENU APPLY VISIT INQUIRE ESPAÑOL Search NWCIowa.edu Search Compass Center About Explore Experience Equip  Toolkit Embark For  Employers Traditional undergrads, online/grad students, or alumni: Wherever you are on your career journey, we’re here to help you navigate your individual path to success. Understand how your personality, strengths, interests and values fit into your future work. Learn more Participate in hands-on learning opportunities that help you gain professional skills and experiences. Learn more Show potential employers how your education has prepared you for your career and calling. Learn more Expand your connections with alumni, industry leaders and others who can help you launch from college to career. Learn more Franken Fellows more Career help from fellow students Northwestern’s Franken Fellows are peer career mentors trained to help you write your resume, craft a cover letter, practice for interviews, and create your LinkedIn and Handshake profiles. Happenings more Compass Center events Check our calendar of events for upcoming workshops, career fairs, application deadlines, and campus visits by grad school and employer representatives. Raiders Stand Out more In their own words Learn how Northwestern prepares its students for their futures, whether its starting a career or entering graduate school. Impressive outcomes MORE ABOUT THE CLASS OF 2025 Compass Center Staff The Compass Center staff is here to help every Northwestern student and alum prepare for meaningful work and flourishing lives. Connect with us as you navigate your future! 712-707-7225 [email protected] Dr. Elizabeth Pitts Director of Career & Calling [email protected] Kirsten Brue Career Counselor [email protected] Kendall Stanislav ’05 Director of Experiential Education [email protected] Caylan Noble Administrative and Communications Coordinator [email protected] Explore Resources For students (MyNWC) For alumni For employers Staff Contact Compass Center for Career & Calling 712-707-7225 [email protected] Linked Home Academics Compass Center APPLY NOW VISIT CAMPUS NEWS & EVENTS CONTACT US PRIVACY POLICY Facebook Twitter Instagram Linked In YouTube More Social Media © 2026 Northwestern College. 101 7th Street SW • Orange City, Iowa 51041 • All rights reserved. LOADING …"
